><given-names>AB</given-names></name><name><surname>Jurkovich</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Rivara</surname><given-names>FP</given-names></name><name><surname>Maier</surname><given-names>RV</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effectiveness of state trauma systems in reducing injury-related mortality: a national evaluation</article-title><source>J Trauma</source><year>2000</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>25</fpage><lpage>30</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10647561</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00005373-200001000-00005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Guss</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>FT</given-names></name><name><surname>Neuman</surname><given-names>TS</given-names></name><name><surname>Baxt</surname><given-names>WG</given-names></name><name><surname>Dunford</surname><given-names>JV</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Griffith</surname><given-names>LD</given-names></name><name><surname>Guber</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The impact of a regionalized trauma system on trauma care in San Diego County</article-title><source>Ann Emerg Med</source><year>1989</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>1141</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2817556</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0196-0644(89)80048-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>West</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Trunkey</surname><given-names>DD</given-names></name><name><surname>Lim</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Systems of trauma care: a study of two counties</article-title><source>Arch Surg</source><year>1979</year><volume>114</volume><fpage>455</fpage><lpage>460</